I'm not very fast in the early and middle phases of the game.  In the
endgame, however, I move very rapidly (usually 2,000 turns or less
from sanctum to astral).  Some pointers for the ascension run:

- have either rings of teleport and teleport control (or intrinsics
for both)
- counterintuitively, speed boots are better than jumping boots on no
teleport levels because it gives you more time to recover power while
traversing them.

For an example of a speed ascension run (climb only) see this .ttyrec
http://alt.org/nethack/ttyrec/cdi/2007-05-01.00:46:05.ttyrec.bz2

